        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>新入手iPad验机流程 简单易懂版</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fbeceb;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fbeceb;\n    padding: 14px 16px 20px 16px;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #f2503c;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #ffffff;\n  }\n  .subtitle-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 14px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    color: #f2503c;\n    line-height: 1;\n    transform: rotate(-20deg);\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 2px solid #f4867a;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    padding: 6px 22px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #f2503c;\n  }\n\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  td, th {\n    border: 1px solid #f4a9a0;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    padding: 7px 4px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  thead th {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #222;\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n  }\n  col.c1 { width: 20%; }\n  col.c2 { width: 44%; }\n  col.c3 { width: 36%; }\n\n  .num {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .rowlabel {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .red { color: #f2503c; }\n  .pink { color: #f4867a; }\n  .banner {\n    background: #fde7e4;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #222;\n    padding: 9px 4px;\n  }\n  .footnote-row td {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #f2503c;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">新入手iPad验机流程</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle-row\">\n    <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span>\n    <span class=\"subtitle\">简单易懂版</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <table>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col class=\"c1\"><col class=\"c2\"><col class=\"c3\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>验机顺序</th>\n        <th>具体操作（务必全程录像 ✅）</th>\n        <th>重点</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"num\">1</td>\n        <td>检查快递箱是否有破损</td>\n        <td><span class=\"red\">破损马上拒收 联系卖家 ❌</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"num\">2</td>\n        <td>从快递箱取出包装盒<br>检查外包装 <span class=\"red\">塑封膜／封条是否破损</span></td>\n        <td>先别拆盒！在 包装盒背面<br><span class=\"red\">找到序列号(Serial No.后面数字)</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"num\">3</td>\n        <td>打开 checkcoverage.apple.com<br><span class=\"red\">输入外包装序列号查询</span></td>\n        <td>显示\"激活您的设备\" ✅</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"banner\" colspan=\"3\">确认完毕 可以打开包装盒啦 ✅</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"num\">4</td>\n        <td>撕开塑封膜开箱 确认资料齐全<br><span class=\"red\">三包凭证/说明书/苹果贴纸</span></td>\n        <td>核对序列号\"三码合一\"<br><span class=\"red\">外包装／三包凭证/iPad背部</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"num\">5</td>\n        <td>检查数据线有无使用痕迹<br><span class=\"red\">确认充电头插脚朝上(背向数据线)</span></td>\n        <td>插头方向不对 可能被拆封过 <span class=\"red\">❌</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"num\">6</td>\n        <td>检查机身、屏幕是否有划痕磕碰<br>桌面放平 查看机身是否弯曲<br><span class=\"red\">在光源下检查摄像头内部有无灰尘</span></td>\n        <td>一定要仔细检查摄像头噢 ✅</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"banner\" colspan=\"3\">确认完毕 拿出iPad本体 开机激活 ✅</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"rowlabel\">屏幕检查</td>\n        <td>按压屏幕 检查<span class=\"red\">是否有严重水波纹</span><br>打开备忘录 检查<span class=\"red\">是否有黑点、角落漏光</span></td>\n        <td>发现问题及时联系商家 ✅</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"rowlabel\">相机检查</td>\n        <td>拍一张全黑照片 <span class=\"red\">检查是否有亮点</span><br>录制一段视频 <span class=\"red\">检查营音和画面是否正常</span></td>\n        <td>发现问题及时联系商家 ✅</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"footnote-row\">\n        <td colspan=\"3\">打开设置-通用-关于本机 <span class=\"red\">查看保修日期是不是一年</span></td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">全部确认完毕，安全下车 ✅</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
